#: ../../../introduction/intro.rst:8 6414bbe06b99466e9bbcbfe25dbda5e5
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "介紹"

#: ../../../introduction/intro.rst:11 1894932c832f4a748535c8b01c1a27e9
msgid "What is Qubes OS?"
msgstr "什麼是 Qubes OS？"

#: ../../../introduction/intro.rst:13 cd3f0b9918e04d60b1e170c5b0624225
msgid ""
"Qubes OS is a free and open-source, security-oriented operating system for "
"single-user desktop computing. Qubes OS `leverages Xen-based virtualization "
"<https://wiki.xenproject.org/wiki/Xen_Project_Software_Overview>`__ to allow "
"for the creation and management of isolated compartments called :term:`qubes "
"<qube>`."
msgstr ""
"Qubes OS 是一款自由且開源、以安全為導向的單人桌面運算作業系統。Qubes OS `運用"
"基於 Xen 的虛擬化技術 <https://wiki.xenproject.org/wiki/"
"Xen_Project_Software_Overview>`__，來建立與管理稱為 :term:`qubes <qube>` 的隔"
"離隔間。"

#: ../../../introduction/intro.rst:16 21528e58d6744feeaa1dee415d56b276
msgid ""
"These qubes, which are implemented as :term:`virtual machines (VMs) <vm>`, "
"have specific:"
msgstr "這些 qube 以 :term:`虛擬機器 (VM) <vm>` 的形式實作，具有以下特定屬性："

#: ../../../introduction/intro.rst:18 3feec9d9349848caa4aefcdf34a85d8f
msgid ""
"**Purposes:** with a predefined set of one or many isolated applications, "
"for personal or professional projects, to manage the :doc:`network stack </"
"developer/system/networking>`, :doc:`the firewall </user/security-in-qubes/"
"firewall>`, or to fulfill other user-defined purposes."
msgstr ""
"**用途：** 使用一組預先定義的一個或多個隔離應用程式，用於個人或專業專案、管"
"理 :doc:`網路堆疊 </developer/system/networking>`、:doc:`防火牆 </user/"
"security-in-qubes/firewall>`，或滿足其他使用者自訂的用途。"

#: ../../../introduction/intro.rst:20 6de35697c679461598c281d74dcaf9ae
msgid ""
"**Natures:** :doc:`full-fledged </user/advanced-topics/standalones-and-"
"hvms>` or :doc:`stripped-down </introduction/getting-started/>` virtual "
"machines based on popular operating systems, such as :doc:`Fedora </user/"
"templates/fedora/fedora>`, :doc:`Debian </user/templates/debian/debian>`, "
"and :doc:`Windows </user/templates/windows/index>`."
msgstr ""
"**性質：** :doc:`功能完整 </user/advanced-topics/standalones-and-hvms>` 或 :"
"doc:`精簡 </introduction/getting-started/>` 的虛擬機器，基於主流作業系統，例"
"如 :doc:`Fedora </user/templates/fedora/fedora>`、:doc:`Debian </user/"
"templates/debian/debian>`、以及 :doc:`Windows </user/templates/windows/"
"index>`。"

#: ../../../introduction/intro.rst:22 72bfc51e69444b829c24dbec410f1095
msgid ""
"**Levels of trust:** from complete to non-existent. All windows are "
"displayed in a unified desktop environment with :doc:`unforgeable colored "
"window borders </introduction/getting-started>` so that different security "
"levels are easily identifiable."
msgstr ""
"**信任層級：** 從完全信任到完全不信任。所有視窗都顯示在統一的桌面環境中，搭"
"配 :doc:`無法偽造的彩色視窗邊框 </introduction/getting-started>`，使不同的安"
"全層級一目了然。"

#: ../../../introduction/intro.rst:24 92d2dc1f3ab74e14924c1f9911037a28
msgid "Qubes system diagram"
msgstr "Qubes 系統圖"

