#: ../../../introduction/intro.rst:168 efc03a90d5bd4cadba5260b5a2f7096b
msgid ""
"If you’re a current or potential Qubes user, you may want to check out the :"
"doc:`documentation </index>` and the :ref:`user FAQ <introduction/faq:"
